Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:02:11.00,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 男单1/4决赛
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:02:11.00,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}兹维列夫 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}2 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}5 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}1{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 范德赞德舒尔普 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:02.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Sasha, well done tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:02.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,萨沙 今晚打得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.32,0:00:03.84,EN,,0,0,0,,You're the only guy this year to make
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.32,0:00:03.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是今年唯一一个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:06.40,EN,,0,0,0,,the semifinals or better in all four majors,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:06.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,四大满贯全都打进四强以上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:07.76,EN,,0,0,0,,including the win in Roland Garros
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:07.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,包括法网夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.76,0:00:10.24,EN,,0,0,0,,and the finals in Wimbledon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.76,0:00:10.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,以及温网决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:11.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Is your mentality going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:11.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,打大满贯的心态
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.68,0:00:13.68,EN,,0,0,0,,into a major different than it is going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.68,0:00:13.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,和打别的赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:16.40,EN,,0,0,0,,to any other event?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:16.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,有什么不一样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.40,0:00:18.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes and no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.40,0:00:18.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,是也不是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:20.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I think, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:20.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.80,0:00:22.88,EN,,0,0,0,,you saw that in the first two rounds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.80,0:00:22.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,前两轮你们都看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.88,0:00:24.56,EN,,0,0,0,,when I really didn't play well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.88,0:00:24.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我打得真的不好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:25.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I can rely
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:25.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,在大满贯我可以
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:27.52,EN,,0,0,0,,on my physicality a bit more in majors
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:27.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,更多地依靠身体
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:29.04,EN,,0,0,0,,than I can other tournaments, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:29.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,比在别的赛事更能靠它
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:30.24,EN,,0,0,0,,and in other tournaments I would
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:30.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,换成别的赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:31.20,EN,,0,0,0,,have been out at the first round,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:31.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我首轮就出局了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:33.92,EN,,0,0,0,,but here I can fight back and play best
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,但在这里我能打满五盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:35.44,EN,,0,0,0,,of five, play for four and a half hours
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:35.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,打四个半小时再反打回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:36.88,EN,,0,0,0,,and somehow win the match
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:36.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后想办法赢下这场球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.88,0:00:38.16,EN,,0,0,0,,and somehow get into the tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.88,0:00:38.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,想办法把自己带进状态
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.16,0:00:38.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and then, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.16,0:00:38.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,接着
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.80,0:00:41.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I start playing better throughout
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.80,0:00:41.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我会在整个赛事里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:42.96,EN,,0,0,0,,the tournament and yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,越打越好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:45.20,EN,,0,0,0,,definitely happy to be in a semi-finals here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:45.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,能打进四强我当然很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.20,0:00:48.24,EN,,0,0,0,,But of course, I want to I want to go further.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.20,0:00:48.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我当然还想走得更远
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:50.88,EN,,0,0,0,,A
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:50.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.88,0:00:52.48,EN,,0,0,0,,a big talking point this year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.88,0:00:52.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,今年一个热门话题
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.48,0:00:54.08,EN,,0,0,0,,has been these late night finishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.48,0:00:54.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是这些深夜才结束的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:54.96,EN,,0,0,0,,You've had a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:54.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,你就碰上过几场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.96,0:00:57.68,EN,,0,0,0,,You had one that finished at 2:15 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.96,0:00:57.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,有一场打到凌晨两点十五
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:01:00.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Can you take us through the routine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:01:00.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,能讲讲那之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.32,0:01:01.04,EN,,0,0,0,,after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.32,0:01:01.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的流程吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:02.40,EN,,0,0,0,,When you're done at 2:15,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:02.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,两点十五打完
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:03.36,EN,,0,0,0,,do you have a full meal?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:03.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你会正经吃一顿吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.36,0:01:05.52,EN,,0,0,0,,What time do you actually get to bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.36,0:01:05.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,实际几点才睡下？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.52,0:01:07.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.52,0:01:07.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.20,0:01:09.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, you go to the ice bath,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.20,0:01:09.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,你要去泡冰浴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:12.72,EN,,0,0,0,,you have a meal, you talk to the press,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:12.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,吃饭 然后跟媒体聊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:13.44,EN,,0,0,0,,which you're part
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:13.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们也是其中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.44,0:01:14.88,EN,,0,0,0,,of, and unfortunately I hate doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.44,0:01:14.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,一员 而我很不喜欢这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.88,0:01:16.64,EN,,0,0,0,,so, but that's that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.88,0:01:16.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过那也没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:18.72,EN,,0,0,0,,And then afterwards, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:18.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,再之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:19.84,EN,,0,0,0,,you you get some treatment done
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:19.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,做一些治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.84,0:01:20.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and you go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.84,0:01:20.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后去睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.56,0:01:23.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, I went to bed as late as 6:45 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.56,0:01:23.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,最晚一次早上六点四十五才睡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.84,0:01:25.60,EN,,0,0,0,,in the last in the last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.84,0:01:25.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,就在上个星期
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.60,0:01:27.68,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I'm kind of a bit jetlagged.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.60,0:01:27.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我有点像在倒时差
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.68,0:01:29.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm playing the Australian Open
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.68,0:01:29.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉自己是在纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.12,0:01:30.00,EN,,0,0,0,,in New York right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.12,0:01:30.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,打澳网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:31.76,EN,,0,0,0,,But, as long as I'm still here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:31.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,但只要我还留在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:33.12,EN,,0,0,0,,as long as I'm in the semi-finals,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:33.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,只要我还在半决赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.12,0:01:34.32,EN,,0,0,0,,that's that's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.12,0:01:34.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,那就是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:34.56,EN,,0,0,0,,You're going
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:34.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚你终于
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.56,0:01:36.64,EN,,0,0,0,,to get a proper bedtime tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.56,0:01:36.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,能好好睡一觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.64,0:01:38.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Finally, you're in one of the best cities
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.64,0:01:38.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,你正待在世界上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:39.12,EN,,0,0,0,,in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:39.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,最好的城市之一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.12,0:01:40.80,EN,,0,0,0,,You're here every other night,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.12,0:01:40.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,你隔一晚就来这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.80,0:01:42.48,EN,,0,0,0,,but the other nights,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.80,0:01:42.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,那另外那些晚上呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.48,0:01:44.64,EN,,0,0,0,,are you one to go out to dinners in the city
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.48,0:01:44.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,你会出去在城里吃个饭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:45.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and check out all the things
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:45.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,逛逛纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.60,0:01:46.88,EN,,0,0,0,,that New York has to offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.60,0:01:46.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,有意思的地方吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.88,0:01:49.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I watched I watched Shelton Alcaraz until
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.88,0:01:49.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我看谢尔顿打阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.68,0:01:50.48,EN,,0,0,0,,3:30 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.68,0:01:50.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,看到凌晨三点半
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.48,0:01:51.28,EN,,0,0,0,,last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.48,0:01:51.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,就在昨天晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.28,0:01:52.32,EN,,0,0,0,,I did not go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.28,0:01:52.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我根本没睡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.32,0:01:53.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I was up late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.32,0:01:53.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直熬着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.36,0:01:55.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I was watching TV cuz I was sleeping
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.36,0:01:55.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在看电视 因为反正
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.12,0:01:56.00,EN,,0,0,0,,in until 1:00 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.12,0:01:56.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我要睡到下午一点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:01:58.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Anyway, so credit to Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:01:58.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,总之要给本点个赞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:00.08,EN,,0,0,0,,He played an unbelievable match.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:00.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,他那场球打得难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.08,0:02:02.16,EN,,0,0,0,,And tomorrow after tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.08,0:02:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有后天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.16,0:02:03.12,EN,,0,0,0,,it's going to be, I think,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.16,0:02:03.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想那会是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.12,0:02:05.04,EN,,0,0,0,,a fun semi-final between two Americans.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.12,0:02:05.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,两个美国人之间的精彩半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.04,0:02:06.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're excited for both.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.04,0:02:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们对两边都很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:07.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:07.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你今晚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:08.88,EN,,0,0,0,,into the semi-finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:08.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,挺进半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.88,0:02:10.78,EN,,0,0,0,,Sasha Zverev.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.88,0:02:10.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,萨沙 兹维列夫
